        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When you were a kid, did you ever dream of being a hero like Sun Wukong or Ne Zha? One person made that dream come true! His name is Zhu Tiexiong. His short videos bring these "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "classic",
            "ref": "v-classic"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " heroes to life."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Since 2021, Zhu’s short videos have become very popular. He got over 10 million "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "followers",
            "ref": "v-follower"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in less than one year. His videos are about friendship, love for the country, and doing what’s right. Some people say they even cry because the videos are so moving. Zhu brings classic heroes to life in a new and fun way. In those videos, he mixes traditional Chinese culture with modern ideas. He also uses cool "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "special effects",
            "ref": "v-special-effect"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in his videos. Now people call him “the Chinese costume change master”."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Zhu says technology helps him make his childhood dream come true. “If I can think of it, I can make it happen,” he says. “When I was a kid, my mind was full of wild ideas. I had a strong wish to perform and loved traditional culture. I used to think these ideas could only stay in my head, but now I can show them to everyone—it’s wonderful!”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "What’s next for Zhu Tiexiong? He’s planning to explore Chinese "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cultural heritage",
            "ref": "v-cultural-heritage"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—our country’s rich traditions—for new ideas. We can’t wait to see what he creates next!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
